{"about_the_game":"Runeroots is a tactical turn-based RPG featuring town building and crafting mechanics. Travel from planet to planet gathering resources, rescuing trapped townsfolk, and discovering runic powers and artifacts to help you stop the invaders.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rebuild Your Home</h2>Restore the town in your own style. Craft housing, stores, and decorations to build the perfect village.  Populate the town with villagers you rescue on your adventures.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/extras/45792608510e468d47469397a33bbbbe.poster.avif?t=1726328182\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/extras/45792608510e468d47469397a33bbbbe.webm?t=1726328182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/extras/45792608510e468d47469397a33bbbbe.mp4?t=1726328182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Turn-Based Battles</h2><br>Runeroots features a grid-less turn-based combat system for the ultimate strategic experience. Fight against dozens of unique enemies in randomized encounters, or explore handcrafted dungeons for an extra tough challenge with even greater rewards.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/extras/cf7377b8c5b132e51f81e0fd09e987bf.poster.avif?t=1726328182\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/extras/cf7377b8c5b132e51f81e0fd09e987bf.webm?t=1726328182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/extras/cf7377b8c5b132e51f81e0fd09e987bf.mp4?t=1726328182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Solo or Up to 4 Player Online Co-op</h2>Runeroots features a party of 4 champions in every playthrough. Friends can join your playthrough and take control of party members when playing online.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/extras/0d0cb3cdf6d4b26b488ebdbd0af1e34d.poster.avif?t=1726328182\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/extras/0d0cb3cdf6d4b26b488ebdbd0af1e34d.webm?t=1726328182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/extras/0d0cb3cdf6d4b26b488ebdbd0af1e34d.mp4?t=1726328182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Powers</h2><br>Collect 8 different runes and use them to craft new powers, or variations of existing powers. Each of the 6 combat classes will have 18 unique powers with 3 additional variations each, for a total of 432 powers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/extras/8823fb107c1eb54a1242d9410cba7a5f.poster.avif?t=1726328182\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/extras/8823fb107c1eb54a1242d9410cba7a5f.webm?t=1726328182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/extras/8823fb107c1eb54a1242d9410cba7a5f.mp4?t=1726328182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate Your Home</h2>Each of the 4 champions in your party can be assigned a home in town. Customize the wallpaper, flooring, and trim with patterns you unlock. Add furniture to make the place your own and show off the awesome loot you have collected.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/extras/f409df87be59e4e3381d0f0994e5cc32.poster.avif?t=1726328182\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/extras/f409df87be59e4e3381d0f0994e5cc32.webm?t=1726328182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/extras/f409df87be59e4e3381d0f0994e5cc32.mp4?t=1726328182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1681330?t=1726328182","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1726328182","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1726328182","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681330/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1726328182","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Runeroots is a tactical turn-based RPG featuring town building and crafting mechanics. Travel from planet to planet gathering resources, rescuing trapped townsfolk, and discovering runic powers and artifacts to help you stop the invaders.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rebuild Your Home</h2>Restore the town in your own style. Craft housing, stores, and decorations to build the perfect village.  Populate the town with villagers you rescue on your adventures.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted 